From: FF7 local experiment
Subject: [E27] retain leaf page tables in private-ABI NAVI31 VMs

Keep the E24 split guard and all existing waits. No effect until a VM
issues the private E03/E04 operation. New control/treatment VMs latch a
mode once; default control. This is an experiment, not an upstream fix.

